{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-07_end","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-07","title":"感染","storyCode":"0-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"6565c8097de5c37eb2e7442bef1bcde3e7ad98a3778caf0f9855151365acae7d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"依照既定路线，我们已经很接近切城南边的中城区了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"穿过这个公园，就是汇合点。不出意外的话，临光和E4小队应该已经在那里等着我们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"要是临光......被袭击了，会怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"要是他们原本想用通讯设施警告我们，却发现信号遭到干扰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我们该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会去确认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要亲眼确认事件之后，才会做出揣测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"不要用怀疑恐吓自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"明，明白了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"失去联络手段所带来的恐慌情绪，比想象中蔓延得快得多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"特别是......在这个天灾仿佛近在眼前的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得赶紧加快速度了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......这阵雾气......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——难道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"干掉他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"敌军的射击！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这是陷阱......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"————！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"不好，我们的后方也出现了整合运动的追兵......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"侦查干员呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"被战场分割了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"追上你们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"杀！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"这次，就让你们粉身碎骨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"杜宾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"狙击干员！压制敌人的冲锋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"重装干员，防御姿态，随时准备向前顶上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace，准备————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，等一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"在清剿了东南要塞之后，我一听到你的消息，可是立刻就赶过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"这里已经是我的处理范围咯，弑君者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你来做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"该把他们，交给我了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近卫干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","aliases":["？？？","弑君者"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["？？？"]}]}
